      "source_order": 14,
      "text": "Et elevet sacerdos corpus Christi ut videatur a populo. Et dicat chorus simbolum bini ac bini. videlicet.",
      "text_edition_id": "edition.archdiocese-of-toledo.missale-mixtum-mozarabicum.toledo-hagenbach-1500",
