      "source_id": "passage.archdiocese-of-toledo.missale-mixtum-mozarabicum.toledo-hagenbach-1500.ordo-fractio-rubrica",
      "source_locator": "Ordo missae (Dominica prima de adventu): fractio-rubrica; retained facsimile page(s) 3",
      "source_order": 16,
      "text": "Et deinde faciat presbiter sic Frangat eucharistiam per medium: et ponat mediam partem in patena: et de alia parte faciat quinque particulas et ponat in patena: et accipiat aliam partem et faciat quatuor particulas et ponat in patena similiter per ordinem facte per rotas istas que supra sunt.",
      "text_edition_id": "edition.archdiocese-of-toledo.missale-mixtum-mozarabicum.toledo-hagenbach-1500",
      "text_sha256": "8abea5be40e5d9ec19642f24f1864739e0aec87b26a4ed423709ea5cce809cfe",
