      "source_id": "passage.archdiocese-of-toledo.missale-mixtum-mozarabicum.toledo-hagenbach-1500.ordo-oratio-dominica-rubrica",
      "source_locator": "Ordo missae (Dominica prima de adventu): oratio-dominica-rubrica; retained facsimile page(s) 3",
      "source_order": 17,
      "text": "Et statim purget bene digitos: et cooperto calice faciat memento pro vivis. Postea dicat presbiter ad orationem dominicam equaliter istam orationem.",
      "text_edition_id": "edition.archdiocese-of-toledo.missale-mixtum-mozarabicum.toledo-hagenbach-1500",
