      "source_artifact_id": "artifact.archdiocese-of-toledo.missale-mixtum-mozarabicum.toledo-hagenbach-1500.ordo-missae-checked",
      "source_id": "passage.archdiocese-of-toledo.missale-mixtum-mozarabicum.toledo-hagenbach-1500.ordo-pater-noster",
      "source_locator": "Ordo missae (Dominica prima de adventu): pater-noster; retained facsimile page(s) 4",
      "source_order": 19,
      "text": "Pater noster qui es in celis.\n℟. Amen.\nSanctificetur nomen tuum.\n℟. Amen.\nAdveniat regnum tuum.\n℟. Amen.\nFiat voluntas tua: sicut in celo et in terra.\n℟. Amen.\nPanem nostrum quotidianum da nobis hodie.\n℟. Quia Deus es.\nEt dimitte nobis debita nostra: sicut et nos dimittimus debitoribus nostris\n℟. Amen.\nEt ne nos inducas in temptationem.\n℟. Sed libera nos a malo.",
      "text_edition_id": "edition.archdiocese-of-toledo.missale-mixtum-mozarabicum.toledo-hagenbach-1500",
